enyra targaryen as his heir  for the iron throne he initially did  this because he wasn't able to have a  son with his first wife emma aaron  unfortunately his first wife along with  their son died shortly after she had the  child  now since viserys did not want the iron  throne to go to his brother daemon  targaryen he named his daughter as his  successor instead  now when all of this was happening  viserys was still a young man although  his first wife died he eventually did  get married again to a woman known as  allison hightower who happened to be the  daughter of his hand of the king otto  hightower shortly after viserys marries  alice sent they end up having several  children together including several sons  now in king viserys's eyes this doesn't  affect his line of succession he still  allowed his daughter rhaenyra targaryen  to be his heir for the iron throne  although alison had now given him  several sons well as you can imagine  things don't stay this way after viserys  dies  after he died allison doesn't allow the  message to get to rhaenara who was now  living on dragonstone  instead she gives the crown to her and  viserys's first son aegon targaryen the  second of his name as you can imagine  this started an all-out war over the  iron throne because rhaenyra obviously  believed it was rightfully hers which i  do agree with  that should be more or less how we see  things unfold in the new series now i am  obviously leaving out a lot of things  but if you would like a more detailed  description of what happened i will link  one of my other videos down below that  video goes over everything george r  martin wrote in his novel fire and blood  alright now in this next photo we have  rhaenyra targaryen daughter of king  viserys targaryen and as i just  described she will be his heir for the  iron throne next we have allison  hightower daughter of the hand of the  king serado hightower and wife of king  viserys targaryen she will be one of the  main reasons why rhaenyra doesn't get  the iron throne immediately after her  father died here we have allison's  father serado hightower who i just  mentioned is the hand of the king it  already looks like he is up to no good  in the photo  he's definitely giving me some little  finger vibes with that look on his face  now in this next photo we have daemon  targaryen king viserys targaryen's  brother daemon will without a doubt be  one of the most interesting characters  in house of the dragon he also just so  happens to be george r martin's favorite  member of house targaryen  now although he is rhaenyra targaryen's  uncle we will see them in an incestuous  relationship together but as you all  know this is nothing new for game of  thrones in the next photo we have lord  corliss velaryon and his wife rhaenys  targaryen they will be fighting for the  sight of rhaenyra and daemon lord  corliss velaryon will be one hell of an  ally for rhaenyra and daemon because not  only is he one of the wealthiest men in  the seven kingdoms but he also commands  the largest fleet of ships as well by  the age of 37 corliss was hailed as the  greatest seafarer the seven kingdoms had  ever known he was also said to be as  brilliant as he was restless and  adventurous as he was ambitious  he will eventually go on to become the  hand of the queen for rhaenyra targaryen  now one of the good things about his  wife rhaenys targaryen is the fact that  she is a dragon rider just like rhaenyra  and daemon as you can imagine this will  certainly be of use during the dance of  the dragons as a matter of fact we  should see rhaenys engage in one of the  greatest dragon battles during these  events now in the next photo we have a  young rhaenyra targaryen and a young  alice in hightower they were actually  good friends before king viserys died  but we will see where everyone's motives  lie once that iron throne is up for  grabs they will not remain friends for  very long next we have a character known  as masaria also known as lady misery now  although she will become the unofficial  mistress of whisperers for rhaenyra  targaryen daemon will be sleeping with  her as well  according to some records rhaenyra  actually allows daemon to have this  relationship with her hbo also released  a photo of sir kristin cole who will be  the lord commander of the kingsguard for  alison's son aegon after he takes the  crown and the iron throne from rhinera  and last but certainly not least we have  an official release date for the first  season of house of the dragon episode 1  will release this summer on august the  21st and i for one cannot wait we now  have an official date for when we will  finally see house of the dragon  hopefully the game of thrones fandom  will rise from the ashes like a phoenix  to take back its rightful seat as the  number one show on television as always  make sure you subscribe now if you want  to stay up to date on any and all  information regarding game of thrones  house of the dragon or a song of ice and  fire  as you all know hbo will be releasing  more and more information as we edge  closer and closer to that release date  and i will be making videos about  everything every step of the way i want  to thank everyone for stopping by and  watching this video hopefully i will see  all of you back here for my next one  also don't forget to watch my other  video down below if you want more  information about these events anyways  have a great day everyone i will see you  soon bye  [Music]  [Music]  you

